# Local-only docker overrides (e.g. MinIO KMS dev key)
docker-compose.override.yml

# Agent memory and per-project Claude config. Subagents with `memory: project`
# write here, and the notes are defect analyses of code that is often still
# unfixed. This subtree publishes to a PUBLIC mirror rebuilt from subtree
# HISTORY, so a single `git add -A` would carry them into every future publish
# and only a filter-repo strip could remove them again. Ignored at the source.
.claude/
